<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 5/6.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 5/6.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Tuesday set the following exchange rates for August 5/6. The kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	  August 5/6    August 4/5</p>
<p>    CZK    0.42857	 0.42754</p>
<p>    DKK    2.09886	 2.09922</p>
<p>    FIM    2.68239	 2.68114</p>
<p>    GBP   24.40283	24.30485</p>
<p>    HUF    0.07511	 0.0751</p>
<p>    LTL    3.74023	 3.7346</p>
<p>    LVL   25.41452	25.45132</p>
<p>    RUR    0.00258	 0.00258</p>
<p>    SEK    1.85557	 1.85569</p>
<p>    UAH    8.06185	 8.04653</p>
<p>    USD   14.9628	 14.9412</p>
<p>    XEU   15.09748	15.79434</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
